<title>SPAIN: Spain's CMNV suspends Financiera y Minera, Molins.</title>
<headline>Spain's CMNV suspends Financiera y Minera, Molins.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's stock market watchdog CNMV is to suspend trading on Friday in cement firms Financiera y Minera and Cementos Molins, a spokeswoman for CNMV said.  </p>
<p>The suspension came after Financiera y Minera proposed to shareholders of Cementos Molins that a viability study be conducted on a possible merger between the two companies, CNMV said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
